  "custom_campaign_state": {
    "premise": "Young knight Ser Arion faces his first moral crisis, ordered by his commander to slaughter innocent refugees in the name of the Empress's soul-crushing but prosperous peace. As he questions his oath, he is contacted by the gold dragon Aurum, a magnificent and arrogant being who champions glorious, chaotic freedom. Arion is now torn between two powerful, morally ambiguous ideologies: the security of the Empress\u2019s predictable tyranny or the violent, unpredictable struggle offered by the dragon. He must decide whether to uphold his duty and commit the atrocity, break his oath and join the dragon's rebellion, or attempt to deceive both sides by secretly aiding the refugees. This single choice will define his honor, his future allegiances, and his place in a world where order and freedom are both double-edged swords.",
